Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:00.80,Short,,0,0,0,,A cow eats
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.10,Short,,0,0,0,,every meal twice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.41,0:00:03.00,Short,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:04.17,Short,,0,0,0,,four stomachs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.17,0:00:04.80,Short,,0,0,0,,It has one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:06.04,Short,,0,0,0,,with four rooms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:07.38,Short,,0,0,0,,Grass goes into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:08.12,Short,,0,0,0,,the first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:08.76,Short,,0,0,0,,the rumen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.76,0:00:09.52,Short,,0,0,0,,a vat as big
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:10.51,Short,,0,0,0,,as a bathtub
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.51,0:00:11.38,Short,,0,0,0,,packed with trillions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:12.20,Short,,0,0,0,,of microbes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:13.10,Short,,0,0,0,,that break down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:14.55,Short,,0,0,0,,tough plant fiber
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.55,0:00:15.12,Short,,0,0,0,,Then the cow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:15.99,Short,,0,0,0,,burps the mush
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:16.47,Short,,0,0,0,,back up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.47,0:00:17.50,Short,,0,0,0,,and chews it again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:18.86,Short,,0,0,0,,That's chewing the cud
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:19.34,Short,,0,0,0,,up to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:20.58,Short,,0,0,0,,eight hours a day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:21.76,Short,,0,0,0,,The honeycomb room
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:22.54,Short,,0,0,0,,sorts it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.54,0:00:22.98,Short,,0,0,0,,the third
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:24.34,Short,,0,0,0,,squeezes out the water
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:25.21,Short,,0,0,0,,and the fourth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.21,0:00:26.58,Short,,0,0,0,,digests with acid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:27.58,Short,,0,0,0,,just like yours
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:28.90,Short,,0,0,0,,So when a cow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:29.78,Short,,0,0,0,,just stands there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:30.38,Short,,0,0,0,,chewing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:31.18,Short,,0,0,0,,it's not bored
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:31.63,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.90,0:00:27.40,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwho chews too loud
